[1638] = "「欄位介面」與「說明」提供目前回呼的明確「預覽」。預覽使用獨立的範例值以及正常的欄位或說明繪製器。它不會儲存、註冊、驗證或評估條件。關閉後會釋放其控制項並返回原始碼草稿。「檢查語法」從不執行回呼。",
-- 106d8f1b English: Evaluate and Validate offer Check with the same Fields UI and detached sample
--     values. Check runs validation first, then evaluates only valid values. Results show true,
--     false or an unavailable reason. Live is opt-in and checks at most twice per second while this
--     panel is shown; closing stops it. Test values are saved separately and never enter condition
--     exports or rotation edits. Source changes run no callbacks unless you check again or enable
--     Live.
[1639] = "「評估」與「驗證」提供「檢查」，使用相同的欄位介面與獨立的範例值。「檢查」會先進行驗證，然後只評估有效的值。結果顯示為真、假或無法使用的原因。「即時」需手動開啟，在此面板顯示期間每秒最多檢查兩次；關閉面板即停止。測試值另外保存，永遠不會進入條件匯出或循環編輯。除非你再次檢查或啟用「即時」，否則原始碼變更不會執行任何回呼。",
-- 5d331ffe English: Functions reference
-- Context: Title of a section in the custom condition editor's help: the page that documents public
--     helper functions (noun phrase).
[1640] = "函式參考",
-- 64334745 English: The Functions page documents public helpers and their typed arguments, return
--     values and source. Context completion and hover use that reference; Ctrl-click a known helper
--     to open its source. Use explicit binding aliases for reusable custom helpers.
[1641] = "「函式」頁面記錄了公用輔助函式及其具型別的參數、傳回值與原始碼。情境自動完成與滑鼠提示會使用這些參考；按住 Ctrl 點擊已知的輔助函式可開啟其原始碼。對可重複使用的自訂輔助函式，請使用明確的綁定別名。",
-- 8f344bfe English: The imported definition type does not match this editor.
[1642] = "匯入的定義類型與此編輯器不相符。",
-- 91fe2974 English: Test values changed. Check again to refresh the result.
[1643] = "測試值已變更。請再次檢查以更新結果。",
-- 4087dcf1 English: Complete the highlighted test inputs before checking.
[1644] = "檢查前請先完成醒目標示的測試輸入。",
-- 532eaabd English: Test
-- Context: Button in the custom condition editor, and the dialog subtitle: runs the condition once
--     with sample input (verb).
[1645] = "測試",
-- e031e0df English: Run test
-- Context: Button and tooltip in the Lua workbench query panel: runs the entered code once with the
--     test arguments (verb phrase).
[1646] = "執行測試",
-- 312acdf1 English: Test condition
-- Context: Title of the dialog that tries a custom condition with sample values (verb phrase used
--     as a title).
[1647] = "測試條件",
-- 34fb96f5 English: Debugger output
[1648] = "偵錯器輸出",
-- e376955f English: Set test values in Test before debugging Evaluate.
[1649] = "偵錯「評估」前，請先在「測試」中設定測試值。",
-- 427ea36c English: Debugger output uses a detached sample and the normal field or help container.
[1650] = "偵錯器輸出使用獨立的範例以及正常的欄位或說明容器。",
-- af624aba English: Choose test values in Fields UI, then Run test to validate and evaluate. Help
--     is shown below the fields. Opening Test does not evaluate defaults. Live is opt-in.
[1651] = "在欄位介面中選擇測試值，然後點擊「執行測試」進行驗證與評估。說明顯示在欄位下方。開啟「測試」不會評估預設值。「即時」需手動開啟。",
-- fba588f1 English: Test opens one condition-level dialog from any callback tab. It renders Fields
--     UI and Help together with detached values. Choose the fields and Run test to validate, then
--     evaluate only valid values. Opening the dialog does not evaluate defaults. Live is opt-in and
--     stops when the dialog closes. Committed test values are available to the debugger and stay
--     separate from source, exports and rotation edits. Check syntax never runs a callback.
[1652] = "「測試」會從任一回呼分頁開啟一個條件層級的對話框。它會搭配獨立的測試值同時繪製欄位介面與說明。選擇欄位並點擊「執行測試」進行驗證，然後只評估有效的值。開啟對話框不會評估預設值。「即時」需手動開啟，並在對話框關閉時停止。已提交的測試值可供偵錯器使用，並與原始碼、匯出內容及循環編輯互相獨立。「檢查語法」從不執行回呼。",
-- deba1c35 English: Nullable
-- Context: Checkbox in the argument/return type editor of the function source pane: the value may
--     also be nil (empty).
[1653] = "可為空",
-- fbf338e4 English: Add return value
[1654] = "新增傳回值",
-- c75ed23e English: Lua returns multiple values in order. Each row documents one result.
[1655] = "Lua 會依序傳回多個值。每一列記錄一個結果。",
-- f968686c English: Expand code editor
-- Context: Tooltip of the button on the code editor corner in the function source pane: enlarges
--     the editor to fill the pane (verb phrase).
[1656] = "展開程式碼編輯器",
-- cc81db61 English: Restore code editor
-- Context: Tooltip of the same button after the editor is enlarged: shrinks it back to its normal
--     size (verb phrase).
[1657] = "還原程式碼編輯器",
-- cb050073 English: Choose a source helper and the local name used to call it in this Lua body.
--     Renaming the local name does not rewrite code. Source modules distinguish helpers with the
--     same name.
[1658] = "選擇一個來源輔助函式，以及在此 Lua 函式主體中呼叫它時使用的區域名稱。重新命名區域名稱不會改寫程式碼。來源模組用於區分同名的輔助函式。",
-- cfaec007 English: Local name in code
[1659] = "程式碼中的區域名稱",
-- d076565e English: Source helper
-- Context: Column caption in the function bindings table: the existing function the alias points
--     to.
[1660] = "來源輔助函式",
-- b49f05b5 English: Function names use letters, numbers and underscores, beginning with a letter or
--     underscore. Names suggest the local binding used to call them; registry identifiers stay
--     stable.
[1661] = "函式名稱使用字母、數字與底線，並以字母或底線開頭。名稱會作為呼叫它們時所用區域綁定的建議；登錄識別碼保持穩定。",
-- b545dd16 English: This cannot be undone.
[1662] = "此操作無法復原。",
-- f07f87d9 English: Delete this announcement?
[1663] = "刪除此通報？",
-- da985348 English: Type: %s
-- %s #1: %s #1: the Lua type name of the symbol, e.g. "number" or "string"
[1664] = "類型：%s",
-- 78a0b485 English: Supported unit-token to localized unit-name lookup. Use value.unit as a key;
--     for example addon.units[value.unit]. Available tokens vary by client.
[1665] = "受支援的單位代碼到在地化單位名稱的查詢表。以 value.unit 作為鍵；例如 addon.units[value.unit]。可用的代碼因用戶端而異。",
-- b2a921f3 English: Supported unit-token to localized possessive unit-name lookup, such as your
--     target.
[1666] = "受支援的單位代碼到在地化所有格單位名稱（例如「你的目標的」）的查詢表。",
-- 7e1dc663 English: Rotation Master client compatibility adapter. Its methods return ordinary
--     readable results or nil with a reason when an observation is unavailable. Use a colon call,
--     or pass addon.Platform explicitly as self with a dot reference.
[1667] = "Rotation Master 用戶端相容性轉接器。其方法傳回一般的可讀結果；當觀測無法使用時傳回 nil 及原因。請使用冒號呼叫，或在點號參照時明確將 addon.Platform 作為 self 傳入。",
-- bbc0cdbf English: Rotation Master spell catalog for resolving client-specific spell IDs, ranks,
--     names, icons and links.
[1668] = "Rotation Master 法術目錄，用於解析因用戶端而異的法術 ID、等級、名稱、圖示與連結。",
-- 18123a69 English: Utility functions explicitly bound to this condition or function. Choose a
--     completion to bind an available custom function before inserting its reference.
[1669] = "明確綁定到此條件或函式的工具函式。在插入其參照前，選擇一個自動完成項目以綁定可用的自訂函式。",
-- 16356339 English: Rotation Master custom function
[1670] = "Rotation Master 自訂函式",
-- 902c5c44 English: Rotation Master built-in function
[1671] = "Rotation Master 內建函式",
-- 0443c4a6 English: Rotation Master value
-- Context: Heading in the Lua editor's hover text for a symbol that is a plain value provided by
--     Rotation Master (not a function); the alternatives are 'Rotation Master custom function' and
--     'Rotation Master built-in function'.
[1672] = "Rotation Master 值",
-- 1a845fe0 English: Global function (documentation unavailable on this client)
[1673] = "全域函式（此用戶端上沒有說明文件）",
-- 6912e131 English: This client does not provide signature documentation for this function. No
--     arguments or return types have been inferred.
[1674] = "此用戶端未提供此函式的簽章說明。未推斷任何參數或傳回型別。",
-- 90092e5f English: Invoke
[1675] = "呼叫",
-- cb214676 English: Functions are shared across profiles after Apply. Call custom utilities as
--     functions.name(...); accepting completion adds the dependency binding. Typed calls need a
--     binding under Function bindings. Built In examples show dot or colon explicitly.
[1676] = "函式在套用後會在所有設定檔間共用。以 functions.name(...) 呼叫自訂工具函式；接受自動完成會新增相依綁定。具型別的呼叫需要在「函式綁定」下有一個綁定。內建範例會明確使用點號或冒號。",
-- d03262ba English: Show line numbers
-- Context: Checkbox in Integrations settings (Lua editor section): shows line numbers in the Lua
--     code editors; also a help topic title.
[1677] = "顯示行號",
-- f12fff00 English: Line-number visibility applies to every condition and function code editor.
[1678] = "行號顯示設定適用於每個條件與函式的程式碼編輯器。",
-- 596578e6 English: Call a saved custom utility as functions.name(...). Accepting a completion
--     attaches its stable dependency binding; for a typed call, choose its helper under Function
--     bindings. Existing direct aliases still work. The Invoke example shows required addon dot or
--     colon syntax for Built In functions. Renaming an alias does not rewrite source. Missing,
--     disabled or invalid dependencies keep consumers unavailable.
[1679] = "以 functions.name(...) 呼叫已儲存的自訂工具函式。接受自動完成會附加其穩定的相依綁定；對於具型別的呼叫，請在「函式綁定」下選擇其輔助函式。現有的直接別名仍可使用。「呼叫」範例展示了內建函式所需的 addon 點號或冒號語法。重新命名別名不會改寫原始碼。缺少、已停用或無效的相依項目會讓使用它們的項目維持無法使用。",
-- 38416c88 English: Choose the editor for custom Lua conditions and functions. Show line numbers
--     applies across code editors. Built In syntax highlighting and Plain text work without another
--     addon. Automatic selects a connected provider or falls back safely. Apply saves settings;
--     editor changes take effect on reopening, and line-number visibility updates open editors.
--     LuaWorkbench and WowLua loading status is shown separately from integration availability.
[1680] = "選擇自訂 Lua 條件與函式所用的編輯器。「顯示行號」適用於所有程式碼編輯器。「內建語法突顯」與「純文字」不需其他插件即可使用。「自動」會選擇一個已連接的提供者，或安全地改用備用方案。「套用」會儲存設定；編輯器的變更在重新開啟時生效，行號顯示會更新已開啟的編輯器。LuaWorkbench 與 WowLua 的載入狀態與整合可用性分開顯示。",
-- 50c3cb6e English: All namespaces
-- Context: First entry of the namespace filter dropdown on the Functions page: show functions from
--     every namespace.
[1681] = "所有命名空間",
-- 5605815a English: Call a utility as namespace.name(...). Built In namespaces follow source files;
--     custom functions choose their Namespace. Accepting a completion attaches its stable
--     dependency binding; for a typed call, add its qualified name under Function bindings.
--     Namespaces do not supply self: the Invoke example includes a method receiver explicitly, and
--     Existing API preserves its original dot or colon spelling. Existing aliases still work.
--     Renaming a function or namespace does not rewrite existing code or bindings. Missing,
--     disabled or invalid dependencies keep consumers unavailable.
[1682] = "以 namespace.name(...) 呼叫工具函式。內建命名空間與原始檔對應；自訂函式自行選擇其命名空間。接受自動完成會附加其穩定的相依綁定；對於具型別的呼叫，請在「函式綁定」下新增其完整限定名稱。命名空間不提供 self：「呼叫」範例會明確包含方法接收者，「現有 API」保留其原有的點號或冒號寫法。現有別名仍可使用。重新命名函式或命名空間不會改寫現有程式碼或綁定。缺少、已停用或無效的相依項目會讓使用它們的項目維持無法使用。",
-- 66506282 English: Choose a source helper and its name in this Lua body, such as custom.ready or
--     utils.getCached. Namespaces are private to this callback. Renaming a binding does not rewrite
--     code.
[1683] = "在此 Lua 函式主體中選擇一個來源輔助函式及其名稱，例如 custom.ready 或 utils.getCached。命名空間是此回呼私有的。重新命名綁定不會改寫程式碼。",
-- 5226404c English: Existing API
[1684] = "現有 API",
-- e572edc2 English: Name in code
-- Context: Column caption in the function bindings table and tooltip of the alias field: the name a
--     binding is called inside the Lua code.
[1685] = "程式碼中的名稱",
-- c4e4e7ab English: Namespace
-- Context: Label of the namespace box in the function source pane and a help section title: the
--     dotted group name under which a function is listed.
[1686] = "命名空間",
-- c6d86222 English: Namespaces group functions; they do not supply a receiver. Accept a completion
--     to bind the shown dotted call. For a typed call, add the same qualified name under Function
--     bindings. Method examples include the required receiver explicitly. Functions are shared
--     across profiles after Apply.
[1687] = "命名空間用於對函式分組；它們不提供接收者。接受自動完成即可綁定所顯示的點號呼叫。對於具型別的呼叫，請在「函式綁定」下新增相同的完整限定名稱。方法範例會明確包含所需的接收者。函式在套用後會在所有設定檔間共用。",
-- 76209725 English: Private utility-function namespace. It contains only explicit bindings for this
--     callback.
[1688] = "私有的工具函式命名空間。它只包含此回呼的明確綁定。",
-- 481da3a7 English: Argument
-- Context: Row title and add-button text in the function source pane: one function argument (noun).
--     The same place has "Return".
[1689] = "參數",
-- e0836fce English: Bindings (%d)
-- %d #1: %d #1: the number of function bindings, e.g. 3
[1690] = "綁定（%d）",
-- 6ecb5a70 English: Call a utility as namespace.name(...). Built In namespaces follow source files;
--     custom functions choose their Namespace. Accepting a completion attaches its stable
--     dependency binding; for a typed call, add its qualified name under Function bindings.
--     Namespaces do not supply self. Pass a method receiver explicitly in a namespaced dot call;
--     object:method(x) is Lua shorthand for object.method(object, x). Existing addon APIs remain
--     compatible with saved definitions. Existing aliases still work. Renaming a function or
--     namespace does not rewrite existing code or bindings. Missing, disabled or invalid
--     dependencies keep consumers unavailable.
[1691] = "以 namespace.name(...) 呼叫工具函式。內建命名空間與原始檔對應；自訂函式自行選擇其命名空間。接受自動完成會附加其穩定的相依綁定；對於具型別的呼叫，請在「函式綁定」下新增其完整限定名稱。命名空間不提供 self。在命名空間的點號呼叫中請明確傳入方法接收者；object:method(x) 是 Lua 中 object.method(object, x) 的簡寫。現有插件 API 與已儲存的定義保持相容。現有別名仍可使用。重新命名函式或命名空間不會改寫現有程式碼或綁定。缺少、已停用或無效的相依項目會讓使用它們的項目維持無法使用。",
-- d35a9985 English: Changing argument or return order can break existing callers. Rotation Master
--     will not rewrite their Lua code. Continue?
[1692] = "變更參數或傳回值的順序可能會破壞現有的呼叫端。Rotation Master 不會改寫它們的 Lua 程式碼。是否繼續？",
-- 2199cecc English: Click an Arguments or Returns heading to collapse or expand it. + Argument and
--     + Return append when clicked, or insert at a highlighted gap when dragged. Drag a row or use
--     Up / Down to reorder; Ctrl-drag carries following rows. The trash can removes a row. Type and
--     Nullable document accepted values; Description explains each input or result. Lua can return
--     several ordered results. Reordering a saved function warns because positional callers may
--     need changes; RM does not rewrite call sites.
[1693] = "點擊「參數」或「傳回值」標題可將其摺疊或展開。「+ 參數」與「+ 傳回值」在點擊時附加到結尾，拖曳時則插入到醒目標示的空隙。拖曳某一列或使用「上移 / 下移」來重新排序；按住 Ctrl 拖曳會帶上後續的列。垃圾桶會移除一列。「型別」與「可為空」記錄可接受的值；「說明」解釋每個輸入或結果。Lua 可以依序傳回多個結果。對已儲存的函式重新排序時會發出警告，因為依位置呼叫的呼叫端可能需要修改；RM 不會改寫呼叫處。",
-- 6b0143d0 English: Return
-- Context: Row title and add-button text in the function source pane: one function return value
--     (noun). The same place has "Argument".
[1694] = "傳回值",
-- 2584fdfb English: Changing argument order can break existing callers. Rotation Master will not
--     rewrite their Lua code. Continue?
[1695] = "變更參數順序可能會破壞現有的呼叫端。Rotation Master 不會改寫它們的 Lua 程式碼。是否繼續？",
-- 79fbb27b English: Changing return documentation order does not rewrite return statements or
--     existing callers. Review the Lua body and callers for the new order. Continue?
[1696] = "變更傳回值說明的順序不會改寫 return 陳述式或現有的呼叫端。請依新的順序檢查 Lua 函式主體與呼叫端。是否繼續？",
-- 2266dd0b English: Card controls
-- Context: Heading of a section in the argument editor help: explains the controls on an argument's
--     card.
[1697] = "卡片控制項",
-- 1f03f52f English: Describe this value for function documentation, completion and hover help.
--     Changes remain in the draft until Apply.
[1698] = "說明此值，用於函式說明文件、自動完成與滑鼠提示說明。變更會保留在草稿中，直到按下「套用」。",
-- 9513dcfb English: Drag a card to reorder arguments; Ctrl-drag includes following arguments. Up
--     and down move one position. Duplicate copies the argument with a unique name; the trash can
--     removes it. Reordering a saved function requires confirmation because existing callers are
--     not rewritten.
[1699] = "拖曳卡片可重新排列參數；按住 Ctrl 拖曳會包括後續參數。上下箭頭每次移動一個位置。「複製」會以唯一的名稱複製參數；垃圾桶會移除它。對已儲存的函式重新排序需要確認，因為現有的呼叫端不會被改寫。",
-- 33f24b5d English: Drag a card to reorder return documentation; Ctrl-drag includes following
--     returns. Up and down move one position. Duplicate copies the documented return value; the
--     trash can removes it. Return order in this list does not rewrite return statements or
--     callers.
[1700] = "拖曳卡片可重新排列傳回值說明；按住 Ctrl 拖曳會包括後續傳回值。上下箭頭每次移動一個位置。「複製」會複製所記錄的傳回值；垃圾桶會移除它。此清單中的傳回值順序不會改寫 return 陳述式或呼叫端。",
-- 74057930 English: Rendered output appears here when the callback runs or steps through widget
--     creation.
[1701] = "當回呼執行或逐步執行元件建立時，繪製的輸出會顯示在這裡。",
-- 47b50257 English: Set values in Test before running or debugging this condition.
[1702] = "執行或偵錯此條件前，請先在「測試」中設定數值。",
-- 96aa8cc3 English: The argument name is the local parameter available in the Lua body. Use a valid
--     Lua identifier. Renaming this documentation does not rewrite references in the code.
[1703] = "參數名稱是 Lua 函式主體中可用的區域參數。請使用有效的 Lua 識別碼。重新命名此說明不會改寫程式碼中的參照。",
-- 438e9a47 English: Type and Nullable describe the values accepted or returned by this function.
--     They document the contract; they do not rewrite or validate values in the Lua body.
[1704] = "「型別」與「可為空」描述此函式接受或傳回的值。它們記錄的是約定；不會改寫或驗證 Lua 函式主體中的值。",
-- 42e8bcf1 English: Debuffs
-- Context: Condition category in the icon picker's category list: debuff-related icons (plural
--     noun).
[1705] = "減益效果",
-- e89b30aa English: Resources
-- Context: Condition category in the icon picker's category list: resources such as mana and rage.
[1706] = "資源",
-- 8f0d1b30 English: Pet
-- Context: Condition category in the icon picker's category list: pet-related icons.
[1707] = "寵物",
-- 7c400199 English: Logic
-- Context: Condition category in the icon picker's category list: logical operators (and/or/not).
[1708] = "邏輯",
-- 9e471951 English: Environment
-- Context: Condition category in the icon picker's category list: environment (weather, zone ...).
[1709] = "環境",
-- 33b93476 English: Time
-- Context: Condition category in the icon picker's category list: time-related icons.
[1710] = "時間",
-- 66f9cfa2 English: Spell Auto-Repeat Active
-- Context: Condition type title: true when the spell is set to auto-repeat (e.g. Auto Shot, wand).
--     Also an icon name in the icon picker.
[1711] = "法術自動重複中",
-- 80b938a1 English: Protection (Icy Veins)
-- Context: Name of a Built In (premade) rotation, shown in the rotation list and picker: Paladin,
--     The Burning Crusade Classic (variant key: Protection / IcyVeins). Names in parentheses (guide
--     or tool such as Icy Veins, Wowhead, SimulationCraft, simulator, Hekili, Mobalytics, Warcraft
